# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a fresh clone on Windows checks out CRLF, and `prettier --check`
# (endOfLine: "lf") fails — breaking `npm run verify` for anyone on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
